        "type": "paragraph",
        "html": "The rain at Forward Base Lantern did not fall so much as occupy the air. Calder Rhys stood on the old survey mast with his hood down and let it find the scar along his jaw, because the alternative was the operations tent, and the operations tent already believed it had won the argument about his mood.",
